UID:pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-global@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261114T163817Z
DTSTART:20261114T160000Z
DTEND:20261116T000000Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Wild Area 2026: Global
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-global/
DESCRIPTION:Gigantamax Duraludon\, Dynamax Dialga\, and Dynamax Palkia make
  their Pokémon GO debuts alongside Steel- and Dragon-type encounters\, ro
 tating habitat hours\, and powerful mighty Pokémon. Trainers can collect 
 GO Safari Balls from PokéStops and Gyms to help catch challenging event e
 ncounters. An optional ticket adds branching Special Research\, increased 
 Shiny chances\, extra Incense encounters\, and hourly Supply Balloons.\n\n
 https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-global/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:minior-showers-leonids-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261114T163817Z
DTSTART:20261114T230000Z
DTEND:20261120T055900Z
SUMMARY:Minior Showers: Leonids 2026
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/minior-showers-leonids-2026/
DESCRIPTION:Minior (Yellow Core) makes its Pokémon GO debut in the wild in
  its Meteor Form. Encounter rates for Minior increase in the wild daily fr
 om 5:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time\, and catching Minior awards 1\,000 S
 tardust. Minior begins battles in Meteor Form and changes form when health
  drops below 50% in Team GO Rocket\, team leader\, or GO Battle League bat
 tles.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com/events/minior-showers-leonids-2026/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:november-communityday2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261114T163817Z
DTSTART:20261121T200000Z
DTEND:20261121T230000Z
SUMMARY:Pawniard Community Day
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/november-communityday2026/
DESCRIPTION:Pawniard will appear more frequently in the wild and from regul
 ar Lure Modules with a high chance of encountering Shiny ones or those wit
 h Special Backgrounds. Evolve Bisharp during the event or up to four hours
  afterwards to get a Kingambit that knows the Charged Attack Kowtow Cleave
 . Take snapshots for photobomb surprises and complete themed Field Researc
 h and optional paid Special Research for rewards.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com/
 events/november-communityday2026/
END:VEVENT
